{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04341","headline":"春女行 · 刘希夷","name":"春女行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春女颜如玉，怨歌阳春曲。\n巫山春树红，沅湘春草绿。\n自怜妖艳姿，妆成独见时。\n愁心伴杨柳，春尽乱如丝。\n目极千余里，悠悠春江水。\n频想玉关人，愁卧金闺里。\n尚言春花落，不知秋风起。\n娇爱犹未终，悲凉从此始。\n忆昔楚王宫，玉楼粧粉红。\n纤腰弄明月，长袖舞春风。\n容华委西山，光阴不可还。\n桑林变东海，富贵今何在？\n寄言桃李容，胡爲闺合重。\n但看楚王墓，唯有数株松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}